<div class="signin-tip">
  <h3>On a phone?</h3>
  <p>If you have the OSM app (or OSM added to your home screen), your phone may open OSM there instead of in this browser, so the sign-in can't come back here. To stop that, either:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>on Android, go to <strong>Settings → Apps → OSM → Open by default</strong> and turn off <strong>Open supported links</strong>, or</li>
    <li>in this browser's settings, turn off <strong>Open links in apps</strong>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Then try again here.</p>
</div>
